{"id":"nueve","lemma":"nueve","pos":"noun","rank":846,"glosses":["the digit or figure 9"],"ipa":"/ˈnwebe/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"nueves"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/be/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-nueve.wav","examples":[{"text":"Necesito nueve horas de sueño.","en":"I need nine hours of sleep.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/594237","words":[{"g":"to need","l":"necesitar"},null,{"g":"hour","l":"hora"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"sleep, slumber"}]},{"text":"La reunión terminó a las nueve.","en":"The meeting finished at nine.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/706579","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"meeting"},{"g":"to finish","l":"terminar"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / them"},null]},{"text":"El avión llegó exactamente a las nueve.","en":"The plane arrived exactly at nine.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/687277","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"aeroplane"},{"g":"to arrive, get","l":"llegar"},{"g":"exactly"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / them"},null]},{"text":"Él dijo: \"son las nueve.\"","en":"He said, \"It's nine o'clock.\"","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/333006","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to say","l":"decir"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the / them"},null]},{"text":"Él volvió anoche sobre las nueve.","en":"He came back at about nine last night.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/707186","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to return","l":"volver"},{"g":"last night"},{"g":"envelope"},{"g":"the / them"},null]}]}